          "model_output": "To expand and simplify the given expression, we follow these steps:\n\n1. Distribute \\(x\\) in the first part of the expression:\n   \\[\n   x\\left(x(1+x)+2x\\right) = x\\left(x + x^2 + 2x\\right) = x^3 + 3x^2\n   \\]\n\n2. Distribute \\(-3\\) in the second part of the expression:\n   \\[\n   -3(x^2 - x + 2) = -3x^2 + 3x - 6\n   \\]\n\n3. Combine the results from steps 1 and 2:\n   \\[\n   x^3 + 3x^2 - 3x^2 + 3x - 6\n   \\]\n\n4. Simplify the expression by combining like terms:\n   \\[\n   x^3 + 3x^2 - 3x^2 + 3x - 6 = x^3 + 3x - 6\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the expanded and simplified form of the given expression is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{x^3 + 3x - 6}\n\\]",
