          "model_output": "To factor the expression $ab+5b+2a+10$, we can use the method of grouping. First, we group the terms in pairs:\n\n$$ab+5b+2a+10$$\n\n$$= (ab+2a)+(5b+10)$$\n\n$$= a(b+2)+(5)(b+2)$$\n\n$$= (a+5)(b+2)$$\n\nSo, the factored form of the expression is $\\boxed{(a+5)(b+2)}$.",
