          "unique_id": "test/algebra/2593.json",
          "model_output": "First, we simplify the expression inside the parentheses:\n\\[\n26^2 - 24^2 - 10 = (26 + 24)(26 - 24) - 10 = 50 \\cdot 2 - 10 = 100 - 10 = 90\n\\]\nNext, we square the result:\n\\[\n90^2 = 8100\n\\]\nFinally, we subtract $10^2$ from the squared result:\n\\[\n8100 - 100 = 8000\n\\]\nThus, the value of $(26^2 - 24^2 - 10)^2 - 10^2$ is $\\boxed{8000}$.",
