          "model_output": "To simplify the given expression, we follow the order of operations (PEMDAS/BODMAS):\n\n1. Multiply the fractions: $\\frac{1}{5} \\cdot \\frac{8}{7} = \\frac{8}{35}$.\n2. Divide the fractions: $\\frac{8}{35} \\div \\frac{12}{20} = \\frac{8}{35} \\cdot \\frac{20}{12} = \\frac{8 \\cdot 20}{35 \\cdot 12} = \\frac{160}{420}$.\n3. Simplify the fraction: $\\frac{160}{420} = \\frac{8}{21}$.\n\nTherefore, the simplified expression is $\\boxed{\\frac{8}{21}}$.",
