 = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} =Based on the problem, we need to find the value of $\\left(4\\dfrac{5}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\dfrac{8}{37}\\right)^{55}$.\n\nFirst, convert the mixed number to an improper fraction:\n\\[\n4\\dfrac{5}{8} = \\frac{4 \\cdot 8 + 5}{8} = \\frac{33}{8}\n\\]\n\nNow, rewrite the expression using the improper fraction:\n\\[\n\\left(4\\dfrac{5}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\dfrac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55}\n\\]\n\nUsing the property of exponents that states $(a^m)^n = a^{mn}$, we can rewrite the expression as:\n\\[\n\\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55}\n\\]\n\nSince the bases are the same, we can combine the exponents:\n\\[\n\\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55} = \\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55}\n\\]\n\nThus, the final answer is:\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\left(\\frac{33}{8}\\right)^{55} \\cdot \\left(\\frac{8}{37}\\right)^{55}}\n\\]",
