          "problem": "Let $a,$ $b,$ and $c$ be positive real numbers.  Find the minimum value of\n\\[\\frac{(a + b + c)[(a + b)^2 + (a + b + 4c)^2]}{abc}.\\]",
          "solution": "By AM-GM,\n\\[a + b \\ge 2 \\sqrt{ab},\\]so $(a + b)^2 \\ge 4ab.$\n\nAlso by AM-GM,\n\\[(a + 2c) + (b + 2c) \\ge 2 \\sqrt{(a + 2c)(b + 2c)},\\]so $(a + b + 4c)^2 \\ge 4(a + 2c)(b + 2c).$\n\nHence,\n\\begin{align*}\n(a + b)^2 + (a + b + 4c)^2 &\\ge 4ab + 4(a + 2c)(b + 2c) \\\\\n&= 8ab + 8ac + 8bc + 16c^2 \\\\\n&= 8(ab + ac + bc + 2c^2).\n\\end{align*}By AM-GM,\n\\begin{align*}\nab + ac + bc + 2c^2 &= \\frac{ab}{2} + \\frac{ab}{2} + ac + bc + 2c^2 \\\\\n&\\ge 5 \\sqrt[5]{\\frac{ab}{2} \\cdot \\frac{ab}{2} \\cdot ac \\cdot bc \\cdot 2c^2} \\\\\n&= 5 \\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a^3 b^3 c^4}{2}}.\n\\end{align*}Also by AM-GM,\n\\begin{align*}\na + b + c &= \\frac{a}{2} + \\frac{a}{2} + \\frac{b}{2} + \\frac{b}{2} + c \\\\\n&\\ge 5 \\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a}{2} \\cdot \\frac{a}{2} \\cdot \\frac{b}{2} \\cdot \\frac{b}{2} \\cdot c} \\\\\n&= 5 \\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a^2 b^2 c}{16}}.\n\\end{align*}Hence,\n\\begin{align*}\n\\frac{(a + b + c)[(a + b)^2 + (a + b + 4c)^2]}{abc} &\\ge 8 \\cdot \\frac{5 \\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a^2 b^2 c}{16}} \\cdot 5 \\sqrt[5]{\\frac{a^3 b^3 c^4}{2}}}{abc} \\\\\n&= 100.\n\\end{align*}Equality occurs when $a = b = 2$ and $c = 1,$ so the minimum value is $\\boxed{100}.$",
          "answer": "100",
          "subject": "Intermediate Algebra",
          "level": 5,
          "unique_id": "test/intermediate_algebra/1166.json",
          "model_output": "Let $x = a + b + c,$ $y = a + b,$ and $z = a + b + 4c.$  Then $x + y + z = 9(a + b + c) = 9x,$ so $x = \\frac{9}{9} = 1.$  Also, $y + z = 2(a + b) = 2y.$  Then $x^2 + y^2 + z^2 = 1 + 4y^2 + 16z^2 = 1 + 4y^2 + 16(1 - y - z)^2 = 1 + 4y^2 + 16(1 - 2y - 4z + y^2 + z^2) = 1 + 20y + 16z - 16y^2 - 16z^2.$  Then\n\\[\\frac{(a + b + c)[(a + b)^2 + (a + b + 4c)^2]}{abc} = \\frac{xyz}{abc} = \\frac{x(y + z)(x^2 + y^2 + z^2)}{xyz} = \\frac{1 \\cdot 2y \\cdot (1 + 20y + 16z - 16y^2 - 16z^2)}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 2y(20y + 16z - 16y^2 - 16z^2)}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz}.\\]\nBy AM-GM,\n\\[\\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} \\ge \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32y^2z^2}{yz} = \\frac{2y + 40y^2 + 32yz - 32y^3 - 32