          "model_output": "To find the value of $f(-2)$, we substitute $x = -2$ into the function $f(x) = 5x^2 + 3x + 4$.\n\n\\[\nf(-2) = 5(-2)^2 + 3(-2) + 4\n\\]\n\nFirst, calculate $(-2)^2 = 4$. Then, multiply by 5:\n\n\\[\n5 \\times 4 = 20\n\\]\n\nNext, calculate $3 \\times (-2) = -6$. Finally, add the constant term 4:\n\n\\[\n20 - 6 + 4 = 18\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the value of $f(-2)$ is $\\boxed{18}$.",
