          "unique_id": "test/geometry/795.json",
          "model_output": "Since $\\sin{R}=\\frac{2}{5}$, we have $\\sin{T}=\\sin{\\pi-\\pi-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\sin{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\boxed{\\frac{2}{5}}$.",
          "model_answer": "\\frac{2}{5}"
